    "title": "A desert stirs to life: Chile's Atacama erupts in its biggest floral display in decades",
    "summary": "El Niño rains have fallen on Chile's Atacama Desert, one of the driest places on Earth, and set off its biggest flower display in decades. The bloom has woken a short-lived ecosystem of plants and wildlife across the normally barren ground.",
