  "sublines": [
    "El Niño rains have carpeted Chile's Atacama Desert in flowers, its largest display in decades.",
    "Seeds that lay dormant in the Atacama's parched ground have sprung up, drawing a brief wave of insects and wildlife.",
    "In one of Earth's driest places, a fleeting ecosystem has appeared, and it will fade as quickly as it came."
